# ==============================================================================
# DG-NET  —  STAGE 2: DG-GAN  (Distortion-Guided Image Restorer)
# DTD-FSRN dataset  |  Based on Thapa et al., ICCV 2021
#
# Adapted to the Stage 1 mean-frame-reference Dis-Net (dgnet_stage1_ref_v2.py).
#
# CHANGES vs. the previous Stage 2
# --------------------------------
# 1. Dis-Net classes are copied verbatim from Stage 1 (6-ch input, fixed decoder
#    skip channels, d1 in use, forward(frames, ref)) so the checkpoint loads.
# 2. The cached mean frame (Stage 1 ref_cache) is loaded per sequence and passed
#    to Dis-Net everywhere.  New OUT_DIR so no old Stage 2 state is resumed.
# 3. UNetGenerator channel / resolution mismatches fixed (d3/d2/d1/out input
#    channels, and the last layer is now stride-1 so output stays 256x256).
# 4. Dis-Net output is clamped to +-5, matching what Stage 1 trained against.
# 5. Frozen Dis-Net is kept in eval() after save_sample (it used to be switched
#    back to train mode, which would update its BatchNorm statistics).
# 6. Generator is now warp-aware: input = [I_mid | J_W | warp/clamp] (8 ch).
# 7. Speed: Dis-Net under fp16 autocast, one G forward shared by the D and G
#    steps, cached frame lists, no per-step .item() syncs, bigger batch,
#    drop_last, and a per-epoch 'data wait' timer (see below).
# 8. Fixed grad clipping: unscale before clip_grad_norm_ (it used to clip the
#    still-scaled fp16 gradients, which shrank G's effective step size).
#
# Prerequisite: Stage 1 complete.  Required files:
#     <STAGE1_DIR>/disnet_final.pth     (or set DISNET_CKPT to disnet_epochNNN.pth)
#     <STAGE1_DIR>/warp_stats.json
#     <REF_DIR>/*.npy                   (mean-frame cache built by Stage 1)
#
# Resumable: full state saved atomically every epoch.
#
# Outputs:
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2_ref_wcond/checkpoints/resume_state.pth
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2_ref_wcond/checkpoints/generator_epoch{N}.pth
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2_ref_wcond/checkpoints/generator_final.pth
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2_ref_wcond/epoch_loss_log.csv
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2_ref_wcond/samples/epoch_{N:03d}.png
#   /kaggle/working/dgnet_stage2_ref_wcond/evaluation_results.json
# ==============================================================================

